LeaseMode.description:
The isolation mode requested for a workspace lease.

`shared` allows multiple read-only workers to share one path;
`write` requires exclusive isolation (git-worktree or copy).

id.description:
The caller-assigned identifier for this subtask within its plan;
distinct from a `TaskId`, since a proposed subtask is not yet a
registered task until (and unless) the plan is approved.

PlanGetResult.description:
Result of `plan/get`: the most recently proposed plan for a run and its
decision, if any. `plan` is `null` when no plan has been proposed yet;
`approved` is `null` when a plan exists but has not yet been decided.
